msgid "About amaGama"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"amaGama is a web service written in Python implementing a large-scale "
"translation memory on top of the PostgreSQL database server. A translation "
"memory is a database of previous translations which can be searched to find "
"good matches to new strings."
msgstr ""

#. {virtaal} and {pootle} are links to the tools, named Virtaal and Pootle.
msgid ""
"amaGama can be used in conjunction with the {virtaal} and {pootle} "
"translation tools."
msgstr ""

#. {licence} is a link to the licence file, named LICENSE.
msgid ""
"amaGama is released under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or "
"later. See the {licence} file for details."
msgstr ""

